"scripts": {
  "start": "bun index.ts",
  "dev": "bun --watch index.ts"
}
```

`--watch` auto-restarts on file changes, which is handy during development.

---

**The main thing to verify before running:** make sure you have a `.env` file in the same folder with these keys:
```
MENTRA_API_KEY=your_key_here
BASE44_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-base44-webhook-url
GLASS_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_secret_here
PORT=8080
